                                    },
                                    "right": {
                                      "NOT": {
                                        "left": {
                                          "raw_text": "without a definite diagnosis of hypertension\uff08for instance, if the patient has been taking antihypertensive drugs irregularly, it is difficult to confirm the diagnosis of hypertension\uff09."
